<title>USA: SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT UNITED STATES IN U.S. CUP COMPETITION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT UNITED STATES IN U.S. CUP COMPETITION.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, California 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark beat the</p>
<p>United States 4-1 (halftime 3-1) in a U.S. Cup tournament</p>
<p>match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Joe-Max Moore (45th minute)</p>
<p>Denmark - Per Pedersen (16th, 26th, 45th, 55th)</p>
<p>:</p>
<p>In the second match, Mexico drew 0-0 with Peru to win the</p>
<p>U.S. Cup tournament.</p>
<p>Attendance: 17,342</p>
</text>
